        "Content": "EIRCODE: V92 VK66. A FANTASTIC OPPORTUNITY TO ACQUIRE A 3-BEDROOM SEMI-DETACHED HOUSE IN THE SRUTHÁN BEAG DEVELOPMNET WHICH IS CONVENIENTLY LOCATED APPROXIMATELY A 15-MINUTE WALK FROM MAIN STREET IN DINGLE.\r\nEXTENDING TO APPROXIMATELY 1,440 SQ.FT. (C. 133.75 SQ.M.) THE PROPERTY PROVIDES WELL-PROPORTIONED ACCOMMODATION, INCLUDING THE THREE BEDROOMS, ONE OF WHICH IS EN-SUITE.\r\nTHE PROPERTY'S LOCATION MAKES IT PARTICULARLY APPEALING TO A RANGE OF PURCHASERS. IT WOULD BE AN IDEAL FIRST-TIME BUYER HOME, INVESTMENT PROPERTY, OR INDEED A HOLIDAY HOME, WHILE OFFERING THE CONVENIENCE OF BEING WITHIN EASY DISTANCE OF DINGLE'S SHOPS, RESTAURANTS, CAFÉS PUBS AND OTHER LOCAL AMENITIES."
